      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM token throughput and burn rate — needs an API key",
      "description": "gen_ai_client_token_usage_total split by gen_ai_token_type, plus rag_cost_usd_total as USD/hour at the current rate on the right axis. Both are written only by record_llm_call, so both are flat empty until a provider actually answers.",
